# Document and sections: Mirror margins swaps the left and right margins on even pages, with the page number outside.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Document and sections · Mirror margins
	Page:
		Paper: A5
		Margin: 15mm 15mm 18mm 35mm
		Mirror margins: true
	Styles:
		For style: area
			Box:
				Height: 100%
				Padding: 10
				Background: tint
	Page overlay:
		Pages: odd
		Offset: auto 0 -28 0
		Text: {page}
			Typography:
				Align: right
	Page overlay:
		Pages: even
		Offset: auto 0 -28 0
		Text: {page}
	Section:
		Block:
			Style: area
			Text: Document and sections
				Style: topic
			Heading 1:
				Text: Mirror margins
			Paragraph: For double-sided printing, `Mirror margins: true` swaps the left and the right margins of `Margin` on the even pages: the wide margin (35 mm here) is always at the spine. The tinted block fills the page area of each page. The number goes outside with two overlays, one with `Pages: odd` and one with `Pages: even`.
				Style: intro
			Text: Page 1 (odd, right-hand): the wide margin on the left
				Style: card
		Block:
			Style: area
			Break:
				Before: page
			Text: Page 2 (even, left-hand): the wide margin on the right
				Style: card
		Block:
			Style: area
			Break:
				Before: page
			Text: Page 3 (odd): the wide margin on the left again
				Style: card
